      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bips/git/commits/9b63c304921c52aa08b2408f41f5b35287da4aec",
      "actor": null,
      "commit_id": null,
      "commit_url": null,
      "created_at": null,
      "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/commit/9b63c304921c52aa08b2408f41f5b35287da4aec",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "8b7c49425046c8018fb2d62a0812ed8a6d7005c9",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bips/git/trees/8b7c49425046c8018fb2d62a0812ed8a6d7005c9"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 8b7c49425046c8018fb2d62a0812ed8a6d7005c9\nparent 9d63a123aec2ba50ae967dc6d2840534a86cfd33\nauthor Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1790708816 +0200\ncommitter Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1793917626 +0100\n\nbip-0375: check test vector signatures in the test runner\n\nThe validator does not read PSBT_IN_PARTIAL_SIG. Nothing checks that a\nP2PKH, P2WPKH or P2SH-P2WPKH program commits to its signing key. So the\nwrong programs and signatures that the parent commit corrects pass the\ntest runner.\n\nAdd signatures.py. The test runner applies it to every vector. It\nchecks that:\n- a single-key program commits to the keys in PSBT_IN_PARTIAL_SIG and\n  PSBT_IN_BIP32_DERIVATION;\n- a P2SH program commits to PSBT_IN_REDEEM_SCRIPT;\n- a signature's sighash byte equals PSBT_IN_SIGHASH_TYPE, if set;\n- each signature verifies: BIP 143 for P2WPKH and P2SH-P2WPKH, the\n  legacy sighash for P2PKH and bare scripts.\n\nA signature the check cannot verify is a failure. The validator is\nunchanged.\n\nhash160 uses the pure Python RIPEMD-160 from bip-0352. hashlib lacks\nRIPEMD-160 on some OpenSSL builds.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRJ5SMZs3eEinN+Lb4iedqLwmlHIAUCau0CuhsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQInnai8JpRyBAhwEA2KJ/KLettKxgscGMITbg\nOUphVHA+zTr/RtEdbGiJM6oA/0cbmvPEUN+Zf9uu5NEywIJ9hPtrG53ccDPyncAf\nussE\n=5e77\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
      },
      "parents": [
        {
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bips/git/commits/9d63a123aec2ba50ae967dc6d2840534a86cfd33",
